    "description": "<blockquote><p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered the <strong>Malefactor </strong>Class. </p></blockquote><p>You learn the ultimate <strong>Malefactor </strong>spell: <strong>Calamity</strong>. </p><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Comet</strong></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>MP: </strong>40</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Target: </strong>One creature</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Duration: </strong>Instantaneous</td></tr></tbody></table><p>You assault the targets body with a sensory onslaught. All stimuli, from pleasure to pain, light up at the same time. The target suffers <strong>@EFFECT[dazed], @EFFECT[enraged], @EFFECT[poisoned], @EFFECT[shaken], @EFFECT[slow], </strong>and <strong>@EFFECT[weak].</strong></p><p>Add the <strong>@UUID[Compendium.fabula-ultima-homebrew.homebrew-heroic-skills.Item.tlpBSwSM525GU18M]{Calamity}</strong> spell to your character sheet from the <strong>Malefactor </strong>spell list.</p>",
